# The Network: official package registries
#
# Expects DIRECT. Must precede Developer/Npm.list.
#
# The package body and index hosts of official registries. Website, documentation, and static-asset hosts stay out so they keep the developer or catch-all classification. GitHub-hosted registries stay in GitHub/GitHub.list. Chinese mirrors stay on GEOIP,CN.
#
# Policy is DIRECT because that is the measured working path. In the 14 days to 2026-08-14, registry.npmjs.org carried 1.34GB over 3180 flows, files.pythonhosted.org carried 76MB, and static.crates.io completed the same way. Do not promote a host from here to Proxy or to a region pin without a reproduced failure on the direct path.

# npm. Exact hosts only: DOMAIN-SUFFIX npmjs.org would steal www.npmjs.com and api.npmjs.org from Developer/Npm.list.
DOMAIN,registry.npmjs.org
DOMAIN,registry.npmjs.com
DOMAIN,skimdb.npmjs.com
DOMAIN,replicate.npmjs.com

# Yarn Classic still publishes from this zone. Modern Yarn hits the npm registry above.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,yarnpkg.com

# PyPI
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pypi.org
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pythonhosted.org

# crates.io, including the sparse index and static.crates.io crate files.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,crates.io

# Go module proxy. Exact hosts only: DOMAIN-SUFFIX golang.org would steal pkg.go.dev.
DOMAIN,proxy.golang.org
DOMAIN,sum.golang.org
DOMAIN,index.golang.org

# RubyGems
DOMAIN,rubygems.org
DOMAIN,index.rubygems.org

# Maven Central
DOMAIN,repo1.maven.org
DOMAIN,repo.maven.apache.org

# Packagist
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,packagist.org

# Hex
DOMAIN,repo.hex.pm

# CocoaPods
DOMAIN,cdn.cocoapods.org

# Anaconda
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,repo.anaconda.com
